{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1159,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:795ca8ff31d3869cae634125",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让客人们都欢笑的漆黑的艺人\\n就是我富士奇石！用最棒的“奇迹”，\\n必定夺得你的笑容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f707e1915edad23125ce00c58acc3cb42996aae52f4e5d611f4f9fed6136e79f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:281f503d6604c440360adb02",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "东商变革只是变身前的名字罢了！\\n我的真身为魔法少女Sweepy！\\n这就是魔法哟！诶！（哐）",
      "source_fingerprint": "281ee311bd0dfa27b5ea40a8fb21d99e8970a52f9b07d8b2891c6b9ac491c262",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cc8e9bd219cf174ef954ac8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是双涡轮哒！\\n涡轮会拿下第一的，绝对会拿下的！\\n要上了，涡轮引擎全ーーー开！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18c5baeb909fc8cd1eeef3fd9bd70ea6fd79ab55fa3e95913c528846d486d245",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3109b3f9f9022d8b7622fc8e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Va——y！大拓太阳神哟！\\n我会在嗨翻天的比赛上猛冲，\\n所以麻烦给我最高亢的CALL哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6714629422f6f78ad90d700288c4f99c3796377ea6adae96c515788211294bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b75c09c764f7e3597b768f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字叫生野狄杜斯。\\n管理方面的事还请交给我。\\n我会以钢铁般的意志将一切彻彻底底的管理。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fce1d5894112fff53b3f988242d62b3f45decf8054580de90be812e53db191f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:356a4fe8a2a678f964d150bc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是目白善信！你好吗～？\\n嘛，有什么事的话随时都可以找我聊哦。\\n不用太拘谨哟♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0c73ce98a1730c65610935936ba6169c425bc886cac2558ac6eb108900961b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10054"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bb47ca381eac7483e584c6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是北部玄驹！\\n以带来像庆典般能让观众们热情高涨\\n的比赛为目标，我会全力以赴地奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35e84bea1cc0c333a421950dc93bd47f1585635d85c8a49f900ab35157613bde",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10055"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f5e6d92a74d55561ec504fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字是里见光钻。\\n这个世上从来没有天注定的命运。\\n未来，会因为我的奔跑而闪耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30e71111a970fa67562ea922c368f953eba244c44d0c5f545db4a7762e82201e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10056"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b08911eaa6fbe64cddb51846",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呀吼！我是待兼诗歌剧哟！\\n为了不输给努力的大家，我也得一鼓作气的\\n努力练习……诶，今天是休息日！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "54f6139c8fd69435cef906ba996833a3497d4eac3d9089a9457454c43ab9b6c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10057"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df6e38661f84b60c7a00a904",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是八重无敌。\\n作为金刚八重垣流的弟子，我渴望与强者对决的比赛。\\n来吧，堂堂正正的，决胜负！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcff166a1a1885ec1ea8ee2669593f97dcb1cc9db4edc79d1f15f3c804248434",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ba498d61adcbfd32c36cae2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字叫荒漠英雄。那个……\\n别看我这个样子，但我一直憧憬着英雄传记里的故事……\\n总有一天，我也想在比赛中书写属于我自己的故事……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c61a237465a6a83b3f5c8ab76314f3539973102f52d3ce382c6e56cface101a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10059"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76c7228874b7a8c746c42631",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是㭴本理子。对赛马娘健康状况的管理\\n是训练员的职责。因此对工作抱有紧张感\\n是理所当然的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec8df16f7b776f755135f018fd05df8bae047d14b2504a848acb4c66776b34c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10060"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:413b1ee7a7c8abcffbe404a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈ー哈哈哈！我叫采珠！\\n你知道吗？世界充满了无尽的可能性。\\n而这一结论就由我来证明！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ac0a7358c17808c7c32706764a5b7cf645924b5d11aec4295d87c3857dfb97e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5b6ef53c68153f9ebcc7821",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我、我叫樱花千代王！\\n与憧憬的那个人一起，站在梦寐以求的舞台上\\n这个梦想——我一定会将其实现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5affeee9f1344443e31605db26f233ab7ea6161f4a9be170df9a699243a6c86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9399abbc7bba1aaf08eb0cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哦ー吼吼！我叫川上公主……\\n没错，是气质高雅，公主中的公主！就算在比赛中，\\n也会华丽的揍飞一切敌人，为你献上胜利！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81e524fe8f55c514639dc565630fa453eeb1774a93884a853411cd73287fa80b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10063"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca06612c1a426ee07a3ff86b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "BuonoBuo-no♪我是菱曙～☆\\n无论是料理还是赛跑，我都会将大大的爱情\\n传达给大家！请多关照～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d465656ba4cf122cce89b03c4190c0592ace7674720dce2c8fea51b9cb640a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e97a371c72a05506f5b5d9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "押忍！我是青竹回忆！\\n以鬼之风纪委员之名\\n痛快的跑起来ー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ced036a4be2b917249a5b5431de9bb175fbc390f0ed8e4154f7f7b261c02d87f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10065"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c12ed23a6b2f1cd7c418bde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嘎～嗷！我是新光风！\\n害怕了吗？老实说，很可怕对不对～！\\n……喂！不要无视我！我咬！",
      "source_fingerprint": "013643540e1e1da198d85ff63415216353267242a4791f329734c617a561e685",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94520ed4f1b696f75d2cbbf1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是中山庆典。\\n半温不火的比赛可感觉不到刺激啊。\\n呐，让我更加沸腾起来吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc9b6fc1e1a1ff48926a2fe2249158147a5026a81c6b8c6317e69226b13228d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10067"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6da3a6257eadeed27e9f3b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说啥呢你！我是稻荷一！\\n如你所见，是如假包换的江户之子！\\n我要成为比谁都了不起的赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2513bccab4057faf20808789951532ead9501925a3c95f2042729bb58a94d6f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10068"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a7b2e15906526ff3bb4d794",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字是目白阿尔丹。\\n即使这双脚脆弱不堪，我也要骄傲的奔跑下去……\\n哪怕只有一瞬也好，我也想在比赛中大放光彩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7762205e972aa100899d067d84fe23aea8f7e21e7d1540883262af441537c76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10069"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:958967e6b063854080539b3a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是东瀛佐敦。梦想是……\\n说这种话感觉太生硬了所以NG，多指教～☆\\n总之看看我的美甲？很不错吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e467aac8efe5c2c68ca5d3c882b73f9a190ccd0b7aad40108e4079bd4edfa9a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d897a9c0228c13d802c13e3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是天狼星象征！\\n没必要对着比赛絮絮叨叨。安静点好好看着。\\n看着我夺下世界，证明“最强”吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab16cac0c5848b31c66f9ffcc70f88b92c2bed50660bd2aa7dcb89d93b760b72",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2edaf213730953f0b1f7cf9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "…我叫成田白仁。\\n我没有需要特地说给别人听的话。\\n只需奔跑、击溃敌人并夺得胜利，这就够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "276b6952694163adc3ce4c8b384e37a7b5fff2401554a1c92fd0e3194021183f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d32cfb8d87ee8d646186214",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可爱的，真机伶Deーsu！\\n整个世界都被“可爱”所包围着☆\\n东张西望是不行的，只能好好注视着机伶哟♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd584f1dad092d8fd0c0228092a54a35b695166c1d4bc0949a29520c4f9dc06c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e91f14db59acb77e5f5fd153",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是手艺精湛的笹针师（的弟子），安心泽刺刺美哦。\\n让我扎一下的话能“噗”一声增强力量！\\nWow，安～心☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "4adde6b7e88c8b1597a6909bce58a9408e5dc1981fb15c4de822b51e327103a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10074"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:488cf71775a656efaffea046",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是爱慕织姬……我可以回去了吗？\\n我必须得多加训练，赢得比赛\\n绝对要成为那闪耀的一等星。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d294c2af95e62885cdd33d5ad71545b4bf54c111b57ee066127723c86c78704f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10075"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23fddf22e87c0fe004eadfd9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "…………嘛？到了自我介绍的时间了吗？\\n呼呼，我的名字是目白光明。\\n作为目白家的一员，我会努力的～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b6293f5cb042d73f5e97cade3bad815de02ff5e21a61c3a1e122453704a63a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10076"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db48e38cf0b7f216de58c156",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好，我叫成田路！\\n为了回应一直支持着我的大家们的期待，\\n我会竭尽全力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78bb59cf9066234d801ca5041df5cb6213055a0accc0aacd5ef8ab9f113e00b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10077"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1df29f430d4ba3ac641b9bb3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这世上有着只能在赛场上才能感受到的风哦。\\n那风温柔、清澈……且无比自由。\\n――我是千明代表。请多关照。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e09279f18c2b5fcb2f1546b5322b1eabc550d3c37e47c3a790b9e6916287303",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee0635c0dbab3f80fd775fda",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字是第一红宝石。\\n“成为至高无上的赛马娘”，是我家族的义务。\\n为了履行我身上背负的责任，我会继续向前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cc61781c1b315036d122336fe6c0f147c412c787f1c99740d9bcf325485bb17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10079"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33ecf86b5d0d03f0600e407e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……我，是凯斯奇迹。\\n为了报答给予我生命的各位……\\n我一定，会创造奇迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d26bda7148d147f062450e04b42f27e6a6d92af3af9a5cc41f24c1524301e9ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd11fc5369c6e9755e8596e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鹤丸刚志！就以我所憧憬的『三冠赛马娘』\\n为目标吧！总之，先全力——咳唔？！\\n……只、只是被呛到了而已！我超健康的，不用担心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d22ddaf8ec7fde6cf1bd65cba2b0528b1483959f319e98d94d1757f6e57895b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9aa5f09eb8d64bce5f7bf55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "――我是吉兆。象征家族对我有恩。\\n作为其中的一员，无论是他们的目的\\n还是给予我的任务――都只需完成便是",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7d9ba78583d92bab26e50ac9942b371edcb1f1553e5741c77b338332dc796cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:444efef0c13a49ad9243d525",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我，是主要从事活动策划的轻柔致意。\\n请允许我为每个在舞台上闪耀的人\\n提供些许帮助吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "65ff80f28b5d2ff52bc356ff01e047da24be97a3372c0c3069f9c6bece21e7c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10083"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e2876088079e2cb1eeac0d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "老子的名字叫谷野美酒！所追求的东西是理想的\\n“自己”。我可没打算遮掩现在的“我”。\\n破坏、踹飞——然后向着终焉，前进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63ad2b7c70c15e5b275d099bf05b91ace6c124829628280e5991826b11018362",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10084"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c7e18d0b849fbae02898034",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是樱花桂冠。我的目标是，世界。\\n是凯旋门赏！――呵呵，虽然它现在\\n只是个『梦』……但总有一天必会实现",
      "source_fingerprint": "46bf29de9fd639b214fbfb9957190285a72eb166f6b8745fd5ba7f1883ba1884",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10085"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1bd49e3ca11610030fd0d76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……我是也文摄辉。\\n我的目标，是风…比任何事物都要迅速地\\n去追寻自由――我想要成为风",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e0071a56be7b441ed320f79fb25825a42798be13d651bc19e145b9bc173e600",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10086"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72a4334715b36d65b828e719",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是小真。真弓快车。\\n总有一天我会成为世界的吉祥物。\\n请用你的那双眼一直看着我吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "32b8ffb7d15fb14ee16b277e776abfc16eee61eb27d3bf3257b64a2d12e683ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10087"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46903fc198b6f85ef6fbf212",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想要了解我？那就去草地上吧。\\n关于我…目白高峰的一切都在那里",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bc52af7ca7979dcf3f47b9742e3895bb95f5c73a4e64a8bcb7cde03ceda41e7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10088"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13c1d82c9e99516bfb8bc7c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是森林宝穴。\\n想跑步的话ー就由我来当你的对手吧。\\n不过，“最强”的宝座我可是不会让出来的ー",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe66ee2a9ca61b32e8243c446a9d632ec37ff1668a02c3388a315c2546c006a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10089"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb274166492f1374eb7d79e4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "北港飞来，纸翼候鸟♪\\n我是苫小牧地方偶像，北港火山哦！\\n……唔，是不是应该再与众不同些呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "b719ce80e2e7f541874fdd253fdb688bc50242e240e585d77e88030132c45804",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10090"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43ffa6d2c83dfcf8b2fbd93f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是葛城王牌，请多指教！\\n如果有梦想就不必胆怯了哦？\\n就由我来打破那些制约人的障壁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "093072ff9cbf5f1edf0a9fe9558b0d50ed22782aa34fb4c57132abe35fa3c64a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cda1dd84a71dc93676f6561",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Rickey☆Lucky☆大吉祥☆\\n我是小林历奇哦！我要用风水之力\\n给你带来快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a2fb712a7361ddb75cae8014c75dd8e49e943f48a96681abd92a8b6e0d78ac5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10092"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:861db3406199202f2fea532f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是奇锐骏。\\n虽然优哉游哉，但我蛮擅长踏踏实实\\n做事的哦。多关照",
      "source_fingerprint": "93950c19b5cdf1216d1e64102bb5b637a622a32112ecc47b8ea7d3d27b969052",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10093"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:432bc6301a59a72a5ea647c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是佐岳五月！欧洲比赛的分析\\n就交给我吧。制霸『凯旋门赏』这个\\n前所未有的梦想，就请同我一起去实现吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b5794249e7626292863f1a828178f6de642159e79a6f45f9be3a69c105ef4dd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10094"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1a151fee9380de4f730eb95",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "开启振奋人心的旅途吧！同你的好友彻夜起舞吧！\\n想要邂逅梦想的Everyone――\\n搭上属于我跳舞城的船来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f1d3bdb60f740625b9c03b7728206fad0ca686562787811f1c9b294dace3332",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10095"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87736f340dfb6beccf7ddfbe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是爱如往昔……我……\\n不，我并没有什么可说的……\\n即便有，嗯……也只有一些秘密，罢了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e38f1e4b855dad3e538c2ef143dc4d1f6718a6121fbddcc6b9513fc459b93b2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10096"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:360c6d2c4795f2c1f0fcf4dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是极峰。\\n不到打破一切成为女王的那一天，\\n我绝不会泄气",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf8ac2fb6a28a8349a51aa6e54f9d5f6550d2e1edb625fefc85c6971d9b25b93",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10097"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1872af9d0dde7a9eaa4e5be7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "噢噢，我爱着的诸位音乐家啊！\\n同我万籁争鸣一起，\\n今天也奏响旋律吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c45bb5b7bc570a2c6bb5da85b820c7142843eee99359649a313466842fd947b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10098"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:149ef008862df7a46d401534",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是强击哦！总有一天，我会到闪闪发光的\\n迪拜，去参加奢华的比赛♪\\n我们一起去吧！就这么决定了哟♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6531240f7f98857b8de6be3522ae0f02c247ba0176283be0377ebff835717b6b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10099"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f04d6cd362865598e56b68f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的愿望只有一个――那就是获得“最强”之称号！\\n我要成为能留在人们记忆中的赛马娘！\\n为了实现这个目标，必不可少的……没错，就是自我展示！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f5bbae48a93b30498d4eb7851f0ff838f1132b46a737c491ba46047249e33b7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dfe95717b22236783352fc9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……我是大鸣大放。\\n我所追求的不是胜利，而是处于更前方的“最强”。\\n…………就这样",
      "source_fingerprint": "962409a25996c7bca6aeeff65285bc088fe6c4b44d9a5476b89610d00a0d3cd7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03529b80e3ce8f2438e06fe1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好，我是北方飞翔！从衣服、化妆、\\n配饰，到持之以恒的努力，\\n请见证我在各方面所磨练出的光辉吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99e98c2884c70aa72b01714aab0ca1e4cf08d12e20a16e1e6f4918eb2450ca66",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b1ca0c170bf2a01af471c9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不敬，速跪。\\n――面对吾黄金巨匠之霸道，\\n虔诚顺服为宜",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7f44389d84ed456ea62a35da9ad8e2eeec1e4e349395bcd3af15a5a7eba845f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cab077b2231c66ad78dd763",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是都留岐凉花。我的日常工作\\n就是制作各类内容。\\n我会把至高的感动传递给大家",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cdb32d4e05f359abc9bcb9dbaaf4efa5d5b3dacce9033fc609dd44bf0b8ad80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f652268e6a20e1ff0716bfa5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……我是高尚骏逸……\\n是的，我自知有些自不量力。不过……\\n总有一天，我会成为――伟、伟大的……没什么，我会加油的",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b95a0c92ed356e04f3ba4bf82f8f430b8eda493a9cdd3e81d963ba3bb6af8a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b64fd045a9e41c8c4ea7ffb1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "新宇宙我，\\n向你提出友好的“接触”方案。\\n换言之――『请多指教』",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bf4e0391b047cfa89bf2b61584d533e8ccb48e7ded9c2e73db8c6e34cd9290d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8135cace00b6c3fbea55dc8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好，我是菱钻奇宝。说不出理由，不过我\\n感觉不错，如果能尽力就更好了呢，\\n请多指教～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5b3b1e0059228aa4308f0b3855fff094aac969bf74705b19a6cbaa89de83a0a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e465a690c2e7335300c38b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是烈焰快驹哦。\\n好啦好啦，大家别争了。\\n吃点甜食然后努力吧～，大概就这样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d60ce6e662814e2662c6b198ed2a3ee292261cbf70432a4a4cfac4849b4fbc58",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a16f05a4f400743688e89b3c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是理事长秋川弥生！我将尽全力为我校学生\\n以及支援着她们的训练员们提供帮助！\\n诸位就尽情交给我吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01359ac72e3cd8d81a677285030e5320774938012bfa4f3b7786a82ca1a320ca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09c596d431486f2b970bc674",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是希望之城ー！\\n比赛的话随时奉陪！我要让你们都叫苦不迭……\\n喂你这家伙！别来摸我啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84bf98e17f5cf1e373e372123f42978fc20acf570c7b4c1dd5e7f4e9f840cd97",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:084c8a0529be7d6b04a96b51",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我在此宣告。『要作为先锋，\\n掀起四天王的旋风！』\\n一起把梦想，越吹越大吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7227a7d78c7b5bad104dcf00e4783074f7be4224ed00f442a651dfb8f43fd3b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c31d39e4919ce0710146a43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "过程和理论什么的，全都没有意义。\\n胜者就是正义，不对吗？\\n我贵妇人，会让一切屈服于我的",
      "source_fingerprint": "08c16ffdba4f6330cebf1a2d9369a70ca2b51b41e7ddf369d3feb469f3ade12b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12f62cc9f061d6b0772cac54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是莱茵力量！继承心意，\\n开拓道路，连接未来。\\n我想要成为这样的后冠赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f433e0a7856710be3253311048037c7bd54d650919d612e431aab4a57ac506a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:124cd3e794a44ce162b7c6a7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的夙愿，是加冕后冠，\\n令其成为我光辉未来的基石。\\n――还请你多多指教哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "16c0a15d855528a6d21ea77aa8ff81b02998392a2ef09a53ce463df465a5741a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94b64cc923870d4be4ea93d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是防爆装束！\\n人类都好温柔，我最最最喜欢人类了！\\n想多多亲近，和大家打成一片！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15983c213bd25b448e5113529dcc288f9bbe99f9fc98cf5a6614b9c8fd890377",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34f5b5bb4bce3c799ed75c5d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "噫哈哈，吾名为莫名其妙！\\n为了一统天下，吾将不择手段。\\n现在就下克上吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f24d068457caa55aabf2e93730643ded3c68ed1991f8f40e683641c834d46fd6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:998a7aa7901bda257c17254c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是迷人景致。我的梦想，就是兑现约定。\\n――我要抵达那“绝景”。\\n请多关照，训练员！……呵呵",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9e5a740041e088c03b4b5b935359a6c80fda8a2348e59f0f2fbe39b417241db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89cf50c196b86a16b3f4a6b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若是远征计划，就交给我梦之旅吧——\\n我会为你准备一段宛如梦境的旅程。\\n因为，你值得那样的旅途",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f12166007f63ec1b58611e776937907b6f7eba7f0d99009bf2603bae5369f40",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:266fbc895b65c1623d251b7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是谋勇兼备。为了养育我、既严厉又温柔\\n的故乡……我要做的梦，很大。\\n那就是“成为被载入史册的赛马娘”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50ac0bf57a1207eafb26643c1d8cc764f500db49b31465e14eb89969d293ad91",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a27ce7878b396a66dbcf699",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Follow my lead!　尽管期待我吧。\\n三后冠的光辉终将降临在我身上。\\n那位未来的女王・勇敢之心身上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb1ee321e6cd1dd2d46f5b295bd95ae0d2f971df8d1ae2ef172c19f41b623d48",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:436b4412dc9b8d74968dee70",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是杏目。就算对手\\n是传奇，我也要赢。因为连别人都不是的\\n我自己，都一直这么相信着！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62debb348f547b5222668117009a722b85562353404fdfdd8e659e9573dd7f17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a25416730b6810f7b6f8559",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我叫旺紫丁。\\n为了成为草地上的花形角色，\\n不管什么试炼都要咬牙撑过去。请多指教",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b702a72388347121934e078afd2d42da6ad4b853f7356504e4aa9864b791db7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6a88c4551a94fb184065a4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好的，放声欢呼在此！\\n不管是7.5浪还是12.5浪，\\n未来的英里女王绝不会败北！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2661bcca44c364837c99ca83ea9c0202b1696a3e49e13ecd1053f3a9621d3ece",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:886c9eabcdcc85814ddf371c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就这么着啦，以后多关照～小训♪\\n一起去找那些让人发抖、让人兴奋的事，\\n一块儿嗨起来吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ddce0afd0979124793267903748d1073a4f42ff7be413f55ae5802c4572c690",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10125"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99063212558f1f7e91b704bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我叫机伶金花。喜欢的事，\\n是把花儿打扮得漂漂亮亮。还有嘛……\\n争吵这种事——有点，不太擅长呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "3363e95b11c705e3745c7aba630e24ef51024ab3a86d3d9ff19dcb24bd22f85d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10126"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdfb5b055675133cd00e6665",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的目标是像母亲那样强大而华美的……\\n赛马娘。空中救世主——承袭之物的伟大、\\n与相连未来的可贵，我会亲自证实",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2645b25276399fd2d3ee8a27a331457ae700fc13268ef7d95c5f7ceb487ec1d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
